blocks.en:
In this section, we measure six precisions of the StreamVLN model and seven Stop Action verifier candidates (Fig. 3 ) on the two deployable backbones. We first evaluate SR and OSR in closed-loop simulation;
second, we measure latency, power, energy, and resident memory on-board by
replaying a recorded sequence of 89 navigation frames. The results are shown in Fig. 4 and Table I .

blocks.zh:
在本节中,我们在两个可部署的主干线上测量StreamVLN模型的6个精度和7个Stop Action核查候选人(图3)。 我们首先在闭路模拟中评估SR和OSR;
第二,我们测量机载的耐久性、动力、能量和居民记忆
重播89个导航帧的录制序列. 结果见图4和表一。
